{"hymn":"S693","parent":"E1238","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Nunca antes yo soñé","subtitle":"La iglesia—Como nuestro hogar y descanso","syl":{"n1":["Nun","i"],"n2":["ca","t"],"n3":["an","i"],"n4":["tes","t"],"n5":"yo","n6":["so","i"],"n7":["ñé","t"],"n8":"Un","n9":["lu","i"],"n10":["gar","t"],"n11":["a","i"],"n12":["sí‿en","m"],"n13":["con","m"],"n14":["trar;","t"],"n15":"El","n16":["la","i"],"n17":["men","m"],"n18":["to‿a","m"],"n19":["quí","t"],"n20":["ce","i"],"n21":["só,","t"],"n22":"Y","n23":"con","n24":["go","i"],"n25":["zo‿es","t"],"n26":"el","n27":["can","i"],"n28":["tar.","t"],"n30":"Quien","n32":["ja","i"],"n33":["más","t"],"n36":["gus","i"],"n37":["tó‿en","m"],"n39":["to","m"],"n40":["nar,","t"],"n42":"Hoy","n44":["dis","i"],"n45":["fru","m"],"n47":["ta","t"],"n49":["e","i"],"n50":["le","m"],"n51":["var","t"],"n54":"Con","n55":"los","n56":["san","i"],"n59":["tos","t"],"n60":"tal","n62":["can","i"],"n63":["ción,","t"],"n65":["A","i"],"n66":["la","m"],"n67":["ban","m"],"n69":["do","t"],"n70":"sin","n71":["ce","i"],"n72":["sar.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Gira el mundo alrededor","Como siempre rotará.","Miles buscan vanidad","Sin saber que hay algo más.","Yo fui tal, mas ya no soy;","Ya que Su piedad me halló;","Dando gracias digo hoy:","\"¡Mi familia es la de Dios!\"."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¡Qué deleite es conocer","Esta gracia interior,","Subjetiva y real,","Que se goza en la reunión!","Es Jesús mi vida aquí","Y mi plena realidad.","Hoy te alabo, mi Señor,","Por tenerme en Tu hogar."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Esta era acabará","Y Tu reino entrará;","Gana Tu pueblo, Señor,","Tu morada y Tu hogar.","Todo diste Tú por mí;","Por Ti todo dejo yo.","A Tu iglesia todo doy","Para Tu satisfacción."]}]}